---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Amanda Vilela | Web performance, accessibility, and technical leadership"
description: "Frontend consultant specializing in Core Web Vitals, web performance, accessibility, and scalable frontend architecture. 14+ years helping startups and product teams improve UX and engineering quality."
keywords: "front-end consultant, frontend specialist, core web vitals, web performance, accessibility, frontend architecture"
page_css: home
open_graph:
  image: "imgs/layout/preview-image.webp"
---

<section class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="left">
            <h1>Faster experiences, happier users, better results :)</h1>
            <p class="lead">
                <mark
                    >Performance, accessibility, and technical leadership for teams that want to grow with quality.</mark
                >
            </p>
            <p>
                14+ years of experience across companies of every size, from early-stage startups to global platforms. Today I help product teams improve performance and accessibility, align on technical direction, and adopt AI responsibly, without losing quality or speed.
            </p>
            <nav
                class="actions"
                aria-label="Quick navigation"
            >
                <a href="mailto:hello@amandavilela.me" class="btn btn--primary u-focus-ring"
                    >Contact me →</a
                >

                <a href="/services/" class="btn btn--secondary u-focus-ring"
                    >Consulting services →</a
                >
            </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="right" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="profile">
                <img
                    class="profile-img"
                    src="/imgs/layout/profile.webp"
                    alt="Profile picture"
                    width="186"
                    height="186"
                    fetchpriority="high"
                />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<main id="main-content">
    <section class="focus" id="focus" aria-labelledby="focus-heading">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title" id="focus-heading">
                What I focus on
            </h2>
            <ul class="grid" role="list">
                <li class="focus-card">
                    <h3 class="title">
                        Technical Leadership
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Align developers, reduce friction, and guide
                        healthy AI adoption across engineering teams.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="focus-card">
                    <h3 class="title">
                        Performance &amp; Core Web Vitals
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Improve real user metrics and eliminate
                        bottlenecks affecting conversion and experience
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="focus-card">
                    <h3 class="title">
                        Frontend Architecture
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Make better technical decisions, reduce
                        complexity, strengthen security, and drive
                        design system adoption that scales.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="focus-card">
                    <h3 class="title">Accessibility</h3>
                    <p>
                        Make products usable for everyone, aligned with
                        WCAG, and consistent across teams.
                    </p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="section-divider" />

    <section
        class="how-i-work"
        id="how-i-work"
        aria-labelledby="how-heading"
    >
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title" id="how-heading">How I work</h2>
            <p class="lead">
                I work closely with product and engineering teams,
                combining deep technical analysis with practical
                execution.
            </p>
            <ul class="bullet-list" role="list">
                <li class="item">
                    Diagnose root causes (not just symptoms)
                </li>
                <li class="item">
                    Prioritize based on business impact
                </li>
                <li class="item">
                    Align teams on sustainable solutions
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="section-divider" />

    <section
        class="engagement"
        id="services"
        aria-labelledby="engagement-heading"
    >
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title" id="engagement-heading">
                Engagement formats
            </h2>
            <p class="subtitle">How we can work together</p>
            <ul class="grid">
                <li class="cell">
                    <h3>Audit</h3>
                    <p class="desc">
                        Clear diagnosis + prioritized action plan.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="cell">
                    <h3>Project-based</h3>
                    <p class="desc">
                        Direct involvement in specific initiatives.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="cell">
                    <h3>Workshops</h3>
                    <p class="desc">
                        Hands-on training tailored to your team.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="cell">
                    <h3>Retainer</h3>
                    <p class="desc">
                        Ongoing support with async + Slack access.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="cell">
                    <h3>1:1 or group sessions</h3>
                    <p class="desc">
                        A focused session you can use however you need.
                    </p>
                </li>
                <li class="cell cell--link">
                    <a
                        class="cta u-slide-hover"
                        href="/services/"
                    >
                        Learn more →
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section
        class="contact"
        id="contact"
        aria-labelledby="contact-heading"
    >
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title" id="contact-heading">
                Let's work together
            </h2>
            <p>
                If you're looking to improve your product's performance,
                accessibility, or frontend quality, I can help.
            </p>
            <p>
                Reach me at
                <a
                    href="mailto:hello@amandavilela.me"
                    class="email u-slide-hover u-focus-ring"
                    >hello@amandavilela.me</a
                >
                for a quick chat or a detailed quote.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="latest-post" aria-labelledby="latest-post-heading">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title" id="latest-post-heading">Blog</h2>
            {% set featuredPost = collections.featured[0] %}
            {% set latestPost = collections.posts[0] %}
            {% set post = featuredPost if featuredPost else latestPost %}

            {% if post %}
            <article class="post-card post-summary">
                <h3 class="title">
                    <a class="post-summary__link u-slide-hover u-focus-ring" href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
                </h3>
                <p class="meta">
                    <time class="date" datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">
                        {{ post.date | readableDate }}
                    </time> by <a href="/" rel="author">Amanda Vilela</a>
                </p>
                {% if post.data.description %}
                <p class="description">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
                {% endif %}
            </article>
            <a href="/blog/" class="view-all u-slide-hover u-focus-ring">View all posts →</a>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
